/**
 * Word's Underline gallery row → its line preview glyph. Keeping the map beside
 * the closed {@link UNDERLINE_STYLE_VALUES} whitelist means a new line style
 * cannot ship a labelled-but-unpreviewed row: the `Record` is total.
 */
// Word's ribbon Underline gallery shows eight line styles (the Font dialog
